@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. POST - buat data (catat ID dari respons)
POST {{base}}/pendaftar
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama":"Andi Pratama","nik":"3201010101010101","prodi":"Sistem Informasi","jalur":"Reguler"}

### 2. GET - seluruh data
GET {{base}}/pendaftar

### 3. GET - detail (ubah ID jika perlu)
GET {{base}}/pendaftar/1

### 4. PATCH - ubah status
PATCH {{base}}/pendaftar/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Terverifikasi"}

### 5. DELETE - hapus (jalankan paling akhir)
DELETE {{base}}/pendaftar/1

### 6. GET - pastikan data tersimpan setelah restart server
GET {{base}}/pendaftar

### 7. Error validasi 400
POST {{base}}/pendaftar
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama":"A","nik":"123","prodi":"Tidak Ada","jalur":"Reguler"}

### 8. Error tidak ditemukan 404
GET {{base}}/pendaftar/99999

### 9. Error NIK duplikat 409 (jalankan POST pertama dulu)
POST {{base}}/pendaftar
Content-Type: application/json

{"nama":"Andi Duplikat","nik":"3201010101010101","prodi":"Manajemen","jalur":"Prestasi"}
